        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Amélie Mauresmo, Pam Shriver, Loïc Courteau\n- Roles: former professional tennis players, coach, doubles specialist, singles player, world No. 1\n- Organizations: French Fed Cup team\n- Events: Grand Slam titles\n\nFacts:\n- Pam Shriver was born on July 4, 1962, and she is an American former professional tennis player known primarily as a doubles specialist who also succeeded in singles.\n- Amélie Mauresmo was born on July 5, 1979, and she is a French former professional tennis player and former world No. 1.\n- Since 2002, Loïc Courteau has coached Amélie Mauresmo, who won two Grand Slam titles.\n- Loïc Courteau has also coached the French Fed Cup team in past years.",
